# Volrath's Stronghold: "{1}{B}, {T}: Put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library." The target is a
# creature card in the controller's own graveyard: a Faithless Looting (not a creature card) and Bot2's Ornithopter (a creature
# card in the wrong graveyard, killed by Bot1's Bolt) are refused beside the Llanowar Elves that Looting discarded (the positive
# control). The {T} is part of the cost: Mox Jet and Mox Pearl pay the {1}{B}, the Stronghold ends
# tapped, and the Elves are the next card Bot1 draws.

