Mountain
Volrath's Stronghold
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Faithless Looting
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x14

